{"id":1076,"date":"2025-05-28T14:53:37","date_gmt":"2025-05-28T14:53:37","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.interactivedisplays.ie\/?post_type=product&#038;p=1076"},"modified":"2025-05-28T15:07:28","modified_gmt":"2025-05-28T15:07:28","slug":"ar-mirror","status":"publish","type":"product","link":"https:\/\/www.interactivedisplays.ie\/product\/ar-mirror\/","title":{"rendered":"AR Mirror"},"content":{"rendered":"<p data-start=\"588\" data-end=\"933\">The <strong data-start=\"592\" data-end=\"605\">AR Mirror<\/strong> is a cutting-edge virtual fitting room solution that blends augmented reality with real-time customer engagement. Designed to enhance both the <strong data-start=\"749\" data-end=\"796\">shopping experience and retail intelligence<\/strong>, this interactive display allows customers to try on outfits digitally using lifelike 3D rendering\u2014no need to physically change clothes.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"935\" data-end=\"1270\">With a sleek mirror-style display and integrated camera system, the AR Mirror offers <strong data-start=\"1020\" data-end=\"1049\">realistic virtual try-ons<\/strong>, instant <strong data-start=\"1059\" data-end=\"1084\">style recommendations<\/strong>, and <strong data-start=\"1090\" data-end=\"1123\">mix-and-match outfit previews<\/strong>. A tablet controller makes it easy to browse collections, access item details, and even check for size availability\u2014all in one seamless interface.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"1272\" data-end=\"1507\">Retailers gain the added benefit of <strong data-start=\"1308\" data-end=\"1338\">customer behavior insights<\/strong>, tracking popular styles and preferences. Integration with the <strong data-start=\"1402\" data-end=\"1416\">FIT\u2019N SHOP<\/strong> platform connects online, mobile, and offline data, making it a powerful omnichannel tool.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"1509\" data-end=\"1731\">Customers can even <strong data-start=\"1528\" data-end=\"1575\">share their fitting results on social media<\/strong>, turning each session into a marketing opportunity. The AR Mirror also integrates with in-store advertising systems, providing a unified retail experience.<br \/>\n<a href=\"https:\/\/www.interactivedisplays.ie\/\"><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-1077\" src=\"https:\/\/www.interactivedisplays.ie\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/05\/product-AR-Mirror-300x300.png\" alt=\"AR-Mirror\" width=\"1\" height=\"1\" srcset=\"https:\/\/www.interactivedisplays.ie\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/05\/product-AR-Mirror-300x300.png 300w, https:\/\/www.interactivedisplays.ie\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/05\/product-AR-Mirror-150x150.png 150w, https:\/\/www.interactivedisplays.ie\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/05\/product-AR-Mirror-768x768.png 768w, https:\/\/www.interactivedisplays.ie\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/05\/product-AR-Mirror-650x1024.png 650w, https:\/\/www.interactivedisplays.ie\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/05\/product-AR-Mirror.png 1024w, https:\/\/www.interactivedisplays.ie\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/05\/product-AR-Mirror-600x600.png 600w, https:\/\/www.interactivedisplays.ie\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/05\/product-AR-Mirror-100x100.png 100w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1px) 100vw, 1px\" \/><\/a>For rental options and managed touchscreen solutions, visit\u00a0<a class=\"\" href=\"https:\/\/rentascreen.ie\/\" target=\"_new\" rel=\"noopener\" data-start=\"2571\" data-end=\"2611\">rentascreen.ie<\/a>\u00a0and\u00a0<a class=\"\" href=\"https:\/\/screenfusion.ai\/\" target=\"_new\" rel=\"noopener\" data-start=\"2616\" data-end=\"2658\">screenfusion.ai<\/a>.<\/p>\n<h4 data-start=\"2495\" data-end=\"2530\">Applications for AR Mirror<\/h4>\n<ul>\n<li data-start=\"2534\" data-end=\"2660\"><strong data-start=\"2534\" data-end=\"2559\">Fashion Retail Stores<\/strong><br data-start=\"2559\" data-end=\"2562\" \/>Offer customers a high-tech, touch-free fitting room experience while gathering style analytics.<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"2664\" data-end=\"2803\"><strong data-start=\"2664\" data-end=\"2702\">Shopping Malls &amp; Department Stores<\/strong><br data-start=\"2702\" data-end=\"2705\" \/>Enhance engagement at pop-up shops, boutiques, or flagship stores with virtual fitting stations.<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"2807\" data-end=\"2925\"><strong data-start=\"2807\" data-end=\"2838\">Brand Launches &amp; Promotions<\/strong><br data-start=\"2838\" data-end=\"2841\" \/>Create immersive brand activations where shoppers can try on featured collections.<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"2929\" data-end=\"3045\"><strong data-start=\"2929\" data-end=\"2965\">Airport Retail &amp; Duty-Free Shops<\/strong><br data-start=\"2965\" data-end=\"2968\" \/>Let travelers try on fashion digitally without the need for a fitting room.<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"3049\" data-end=\"3146\"><strong data-start=\"3049\" data-end=\"3073\">Events &amp; Trade Shows<\/strong><br data-start=\"3073\" data-end=\"3076\" \/>Draw attention and foot traffic with interactive try-on experiences.<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"3150\" data-end=\"3276\"><strong data-start=\"3150\" data-end=\"3174\">E-Commerce Showrooms<\/strong><br data-start=\"3174\" data-end=\"3177\" \/>Bridge the gap between online and in-store shopping with virtual fittings linked to your catalog.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<ul>\n<li data-start=\"1478\" data-end=\"1509\">Lifelike 3D Virtual Fitting<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"1478\" data-end=\"1509\">Style Suggestions &amp; Coordination<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"1478\" data-end=\"1509\">Tablet-Controlled Interface<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"1478\" data-end=\"1509\">Omnichannel Integration<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"1478\" data-end=\"1509\">Social Media Sharing<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"1478\" data-end=\"1509\">Retail Data Insights<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"1478\" data-end=\"1509\">In-Store System Integration<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"1478\" data-end=\"1509\">Touch-Free Experience<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n","protected":false},"featured_media":1077,"template":"","meta":{"_